WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.000
Ah,

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.800
so this is the shining Star of the East.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.470
Those old dogs of the Round Table

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.840
should come and see this with their own eyes

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.680
instead of spinning armchair theories.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.100
They should see this diamond in the rough...

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.240
the Star of the East.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.760
In that sense, da Vinci 
may be very insightful.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.690
Ah...

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.700
So beautiful...

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.290
The Oda castle is our destination.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.440
No matter what it takes,
 it shall fall to us.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:52.880
So his fate is sealed.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.010
With the full cooperation 
of the advisors...

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.390
...finish the Fool.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.860
If I may, Father,

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.100
I believe Brother has 
given this some thought.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.560
Nobukatsu, War Armor alone is 
not enough to seize victory.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.720
A mere show of your War Armor's power

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.140
will not garner you followers.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.060
More than ever, it is vital

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.770
that you prove yourself a worthy ruler.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:59.240
Nobunaga, you currently do not 
possess any worthy qualities.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.780
If we just sit around,

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.660
Takeda will overtake us.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:05.840
Then let me ask you this:

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.970
can you defeat all of Takeda's 
forces with just your War Armor?

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.290
With just yourself?

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.800
The size of the enemy's forces 
is not the issue here!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.040
Brother!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.360
You must know your men well,

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.600
or you will never win, 
even after a hundred battles.

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:26.350
You are ignorant of how 
our men think and feel.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.940
That stubborn old goat!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.510
You must be more respectful.

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:35.960
If you continue to openly oppose him,

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:38.060
you will lose everyone's trust.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:42.040
In fact, assassins may be sent after you

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.680
by Nobukatsu-sama's supporters.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.520
I'd be happy if someone bold enough

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.810
to go through with that was 
actually in this castle.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.970
Man, they're all so...

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:55.530
Ranmaru

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.300
Jeez!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.830
That I will take Queen Himiko of Yamatai...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.990
To be my wif...

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.090
One more time!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.590
So, is Nobuhide-sama against it?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:25.770
Seems like it.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:29.480
That's too bad! And after we raised all 
that money with the engagement ceremony, too.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:30.700
What are we going to do?

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.870
What's there to wonder about?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.680
We have no idea when the 
Takeda will attack us again.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.320
We'll have to prepare by doing that main...

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.110
What was it? Maindocoat?

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:41.610
Maintenance!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:45.450
Right, do that maintenance thing and wait.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:55.590
We'll show all of them what 
our War Armor can do!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.530
Then they'll have no complaints.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:58.710
All right!

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.600
If we do this, then let's 
make a show of it!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:02.560
Yeah, that's my plan.

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:07.780
We'll start by destroying 
Fuurin Kazan!

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:10.270
Nobunaga-sama!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.970
Ichihime-sama wants to see you!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.560
Huh?

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.600
Don't worry so, Ichi.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.050
That, I cannot do.

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:25.920
Those naturally gifted are able 
to see your true potential,

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.420
but the majority do not 
understand what it is.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.610
But eventually...

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.220
I'm sorry.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.960
I have said too much.

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.150
Nobu?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.110
How do you activate this again?

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:45.490
Oh, my.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.980
So much time has passed,

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.810
but my husband-to-be is still 
obsessed with that War Armor.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.330
He's been neglecting me.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.700
After I finally attain my heart's 
desire and become his wife—

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.990
if this is the reality of that,

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:18.000
it is far from what I had hoped for.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.220
What does he find lacking in me?

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.890
What do I lack?

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.850
What are you?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.280
Ichihime-sama is here.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.100
She says she brings word from Nobunaga-sama.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:39.990
What?!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.460
He has a message for me?!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:46.470
H-Has the day finally come 
to welcome him to my bed?

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.640
Oh, what should I do?

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.650
My heart's pounding!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:53.430
Calm down, calm down...

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.480
Calm down, you!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.140
I'm coming out! Bring my towel.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.420
Yes, your majesty.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.820
Why will my husband-to-be 
not come here in person?

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:12.060
Unfortunately, he had matters to 
attend to, so I came in his stead.

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:17.410
What could be more important 
than his new betrothed?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:21.210
He spoke of many tasks to complete in 
order to prepare for an enemy assault.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.340
I see.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:28.150
My brother has always been one to become 
obsessed with a new interest.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:32.080
As a young girl, I myself was often 
left behind in the mountains.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.400
What, in the mountains?

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.420
Indeed.

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:39.390
But my brother was always the 
the one who came back for me.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.640
How strange.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.650
And, what did he wish to ask of me?

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:50.410
He would like to learn how 
to activate the Regalia.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:53.220
I am asking this of you in his stead.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.110
I refuse!

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:54.890
What?

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.870
I shall tell him how myself, in person.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.810
It is my duty to assist him!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.960
Thank you, your majesty.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:57.320
Now that the connection 
has been forged,

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.920
the Regalia will obey your will.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:06.900
It was inevitable!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.020
What troubles you?

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:23.250
The words of God are fickle and 
present themselves without warning.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:27.350
Why not try these again, then?

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.830
Go on.

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.810
The Tower, in reverse?

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:48.850
This card signifies conceit 
and divine anger.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.360
It is an ill omen.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.750
Is Nobunaga the Savior-King,

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:01.000
or a destructive beast?

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.420
God is said to have two faces.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:05.390
Two?

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.280
One is the creator of all,

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:11.340
and the other is the ultimate destroyer.

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:15.040
Creation and destruction... which one?

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:19.540
It may be our destiny to determine that.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.410
Creation and destruction.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.070
Now is the time!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:40.640
We're making our move!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.370
Bring The Fool!

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:51.270
A toast to the march forward!

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.090
Wait!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.750
If you insist on going,

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.330
cut me down first!

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:08.140
There is no honor in 
fighting a weakling, Dad.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:10.600
What is going on?

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:13.570
The young master has lost his mind again.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:15.590
No matter.

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:16.290
Just go!

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.610
Brother?!

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:25.750
Nobu!

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.630
Brother, please stay with us.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:29.800
Stop the engines!

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:30.630
Nobu is...

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:33.530
Nobu!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:34.640
Hang on!

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:46.910
He's been paralyzed?

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.770
His drink seems to have been poisoned.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:54.240
So Takeda's agents have 
infiltrated even this castle.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.260
Urgent news, my lords!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.520
A large Takeda force is attacking!

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:02.720
What?!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:05.480
What Nobu said has come true!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.420
How do you intend to 
respond to this threat?

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:16.690
So was this all planned?

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.680
I am entrusting Nobunaga to you.

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:24.620
Yes, my lord.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:25.830
Ichi.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:26.850
Yes, Father?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.510
If worse comes to worst, 
give it to Nobunaga.

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:30.780
As you wish.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.720
Bring me my War Armor, Marishiten!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:41.600
"When spring comes, ice melts.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.750
I will see myself on the water's surface."

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.190
Listen, Ichi.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:51.600
No matter what happens, you must 
continue to have faith in Nobunaga.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:52.360
Yes, Father.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:55.840
Father, I will come with you.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.490
Now that Nobunaga has fallen,

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.950
you must protect the castle.

00:12:58.950 --> 00:12:59.810
Understood?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.240
Yes, Father.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.870
Forward!

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:06.920
Onward to meet our foes!

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:10.700
The Oda forces are on the march.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:14.020
So the Fool of Oda has finally taken action.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.930
No, my lord. It is Clan Lord Nobuhide 
himself on the front lines.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.090
What?!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.460
So it's begun...

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:50.790
I will go join them, as well!

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:01.370
I am Oda Nobuhide!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.440
Prepare yourselves!

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:08.610
Lord Shingen.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:11.480
I request a duel.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:13.690
Ah, Lord Nobuhide.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:15.730
Though your War Armor is old,

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.250
I will not take it easy on you!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.330
Have you come to?

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:35.900
Is that the Takeda?

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:36.640
Yes.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.450
Let me go!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.940
This castle will fall if I don't!

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.230
Wait, Nobu.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.060
If you rush into action, you will 
risk the censure of the advisors.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.960
Mitsu, it was you who poisoned me.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:59.450
There are those who would seek to 
assassinate you during the chaos of battle.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:00.530
And?

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.080
So I plotted to redeem your honor

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.770
and to put an end to the assassination plot.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:12.010
But I cannot lie here forever 
without it dulling my senses.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:12.770
Let's go!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:14.670
Well, don't be so hasty.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:15.210
What?

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:18.180
Let's stay here and keep watch for a while.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.680
Once the castle faces certain doom,

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:23.190
you can use The Fool 
to save the day,

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.310
right in front of the advisors' very eyes.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:31.840
Then no one, not even 
Nobuhide-sama, will oppose you.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.590
You're more cunning than 
I am, that's for sure.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.610
Still, don't you think it 
is just about that time?

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:41.780
You may be right.

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:42.550
Monkey!

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:45.010
I told you not to call me Monkey!

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:46.370
Are we ready?

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.480
Good and ready!

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.750
My lord!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:24.510
You're a pitiful sight, Dad.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:28.050
I'm not so old that I need to 
be saved by the likes of you.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:30.780
Fool!

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.250
I've been waiting for you.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.700
Great Spirit of Suwa!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:41.630
Become the soul of 
mine armor, Fuurin Kazan!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.630
From here on out, I am your opponent.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.400
My husband-to-be shall win without fail.

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:47.790
Yes.

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:57.580
You're weak, Fool-Brat!

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.310
Don't burst a vein, Pops!

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:16.830
You're quite the cunning one yourself.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.320
Not you, too, da Vinci-dono.

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.270
An ill omen...

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.520
I hope I'm only imagining it.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:32.680
What is that?!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:36.350
Who are you?!

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:49.280
I am a brother of King 
Arthur's Round Table,

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:51.270
Gaius Julius Caesar.

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:54.130
For certain reasons, I have 
come to Takeda's aid!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.970
Aid... from King Arthur?

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.070
A Giant War Armor unit from 
the West, joining the fray?

00:17:59.070 --> 00:17:59.950
Why?

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:02.810
He is General Caesar,
 a brother of the Round Table.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.070
He is an uninvited guest to this banquet.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.120
Pity that even the Takeda will 
accept aid from the West!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:15.720
I know of no one who dons 
an Armor such as this.

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:17.980
Very well.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.830
That will do... for now.

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:27.810
Nobu?!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:29.840
I didn't expect this!

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.050
Hideyoshi, I'm going out!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:34.800
Prep a War Armor unit with 
ammo strapped to it!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:37.620
Do it!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.880
<i>The southeast weakens!</i>

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:38.370
Yes, sir!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.900
<i>The enemy will focus its fire there!</i>

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:41.750
<i>Begin barrage, now!</i>

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:49.620
I will be with you soon.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.240
Caesar, you bastard!

00:18:58.770 --> 00:18:59.400
Shingen!

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.290
Though it pains me to accept 
aid from a foreigner,

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:03.910
I am the leader of my people.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:06.780
I cannot permit someone who may threaten

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:08.880
my people in the future to live!

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:09.950
Damn!

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:11.700
Prepare yourself!

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:18.380
Another Giant War Armor unit!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:21.520
You are denied!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:22.910
My lord?!

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.060
Nobuhide-sama?

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.400
My lord, it is too dangerous!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:33.910
Father!

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:40.480
I will let no one pass!

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:41.980
Out of my way!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.650
Well done, Ranmaru!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:03.730
Father!

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:15.330
Dad...

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:25.760
It... can't be...

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:31.990
This card signifies conceit 
and divine anger.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.500
That card...

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:39.630
The ill omen was referring to Nobuhide-sama?

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:52.780
The enraged dragon!

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:57.990
This... is the Fool-Brat's doing!

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:01.530
The Star of the East is 
an interesting place.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.190
Goddess, please forgive me 
for taking my leave, for now.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.900
It was just as you said...

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:25.400
Perhaps I was weak.

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:28.850
But if we are indeed entering a new era,

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:32.630
the old guard, those like 
myself, must pass away.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:35.060
I leave the rest to you.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:37.060
Dad...

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:42.780
"When spring comes, ice melts.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:46.200
I will see myself on the water's surface."

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:49.440
Do you understand this poem now?

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:51.650
Dad, don't talk.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:57.450
I was just like you when I was younger.

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:00.120
My lord!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:05.340
You may not accept this now,

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.740
but eventually...

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:15.540
Nobunaga,

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.860
trust the one you see reflected on the water

00:22:21.070 --> 00:22:22.490
and go...

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.210
Father!

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:29.140
My lord!

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:30.230
That card...

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:33.380
I have made a terrible mistake.

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:39.340
I will... I will never forgive him!

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:13.870
<i>The cherry blossoms dance through the air,</i>

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:15.930
<i>in remembrance of joy and tears.</i>

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:20.060
<i>The significance of my husband-to-be's 
potential becomes known.</i>

00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:22.320
<i>Next time: Strength.</i>

00:24:22.790 --> 00:24:25.080
<i>It may have been all too much 
for an innocent maiden.</i>
